  {"id":"ch_77","status":"requires_capture","amount":{"value":4000,"currency":"eur"},"risk_score":12}
```
The 2025-11-20 account gets only the 2026-04-01 change undone: a flat `amount` plus `currency`, but the new status name. The oldest account gets both undone. Every account sees `risk_score`: adding a field needed no entry, because clients ignore fields they don't know. The core code only ever builds the newest shape; the price is a list of change modules that grows with every breaking change and is rarely deleted.

